  "goodToKnow": "Die Fertigung is production or manufacturing, typical of engineering language: die Serienfertigung (series production), die Einzelfertigung (one-off production), die Fertigungshalle. Germany's Mittelstand is famous for high-quality Fertigung. The verbs are fertigen and anfertigen (to make): eine Kopie anfertigen. From fertig (finished, ready). Fertighäuser are prefabricated houses. Plural: die Fertigungen."
